--Description:  Create Estonia’s bounding box from the multipolygon whose tag “wikidata” = Q191.  
--Within that envelope, select each multipolygon that intersects it, has at least one “name”  
--tag, and has NO “wikidata” tag.  Join each candidate to PLANET_FEATURES_POINTS, count the  
--point-features inside, order by the count, and return the TWO polygons with the highest  
--totals, displaying their aggregated name(s) (LISTAGG delimiter '; ') and point counts.

WITH q191 AS (  -- Estonia bounding box
